@ProjetoMidasAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5059
@BearerToken = COLE_SEU_TOKEN

### Listar transacoes
GET {{ProjetoMidasAPI_HostAddress}}/Transactions?type=PROJECTED
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Criar lancamento manual realizado
POST {{ProjetoMidasAPI_HostAddress}}/Transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "REALIZED",
  "amount": 150.75,
  "date": "2026-03-22",
  "description": "Mercado",
  "category": "Alimentacao"
}

### Criar recorrencia mensal
POST {{ProjetoMidasAPI_HostAddress}}/Transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1200,
  "date": "2026-04-05",
  "description": "Aluguel",
  "category": "Moradia",
  "recurrence": {
    "frequency": "MONTHLY",
    "occurrences": 6,
    "monthlyMode": "FIXED_DAY",
    "dayOfMonth": 5
  }
}

### Confirmar transacao
POST {{ProjetoMidasAPI_HostAddress}}/Transactions/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Criar emprestimo
POST {{ProjetoMidasAPI_HostAddress}}/Transactions/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalAmount": 10000,
  "interestRate": 12,
  "numberOfInstallments": 12,
  "firstInstallmentDate": "2026-04-10",
  "description": "Emprestimo capital de giro",
  "category": "Credito"
}

### Confirmar emprestimo
POST {{ProjetoMidasAPI_HostAddress}}/Transactions/loans/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "createInboundTransaction": true,
  "receivedAt": "2026-03-22",
  "inboundDescription": "Valor recebido do emprestimo",
  "inboundCategory": "Entrada de credito"
}
